  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Information and Communications Infrastructure Development Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&apos;s long-term development objectives are to:  (a) significantly increase the coverage and use of relevant ICT services among the rural population through an incentive program designed to encourage the participation of private operators in the rural segment of the ICT market; and (b) increase private sector participation in the delivery of e-Government services, thereby improving public sector utilization of ICT.</narrative>
  </description>
